(7762138, 1286013, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, mysterious and spooky, even.  Looks like a choir raising silent voices into the forest.  The black and white treatment is perfect.  Do I detect a blue cast?  Moonlight.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely, mysterious and spooky, even.  Looks like a choir raising silent voices into the forest.  The black and white treatment is perfect.  Do I detect a blue cast?  Moonlight.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2024-01-14 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
